    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamakheese ka Wele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese, nga omuloli we khunyaasibwa khwa Kristo lundi omusaakhulu, mulalakho khu basaangi be luyali lulifunulibwa. Nikoonjelela basaakhulu be chikanisa mwinywe, ndi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.21.15+JHN.21.16+JHN.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yn. 21.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ba babaayi be kamakheese niko Wele amuelesia enywe ne khukaliinda khulwe khukhwerusia. Ne mukhaba babaayi khulwe khweyingiilila tawe, ne kakhali khola kimilimo ekio khukhwama mu liekoomba lia ng'ali khukhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhakhaka khukhwamiia abo baali aasi we buliindi bwenywe tawe, ne kakhali khe mube silolelo khu makheese ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga Omwaayi Omukhulu ne aliicha, mukhanyoole ekutwa eye luyali ekhatibia buwaanga bwayo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chis. 3.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu ngila ng'eneyo, enywe basoleeli baele, khukhwola murie basaakhulu. Khukhwola enywe mweesi mwefware liliefwiilisia, murichane mwabeene ne mwabeene, sikila liiandiko libolanga lili, “Wele akhiingililanga babebonia ne kakhali aananga kumwalaalo khwaabo babeboombia” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 23.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 14.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khwako yeboombia mwabeene aasi we kumukhono kwa Wele kwe kamaani, nio amusute angaaki mu siise sisiolaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulekhele niye liliendekhelela lienywe lioosi, sikila niye amwinaanilanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeliinda lundi ba meso! Omusiku wenywe Sietani enyolanga kalaa nga etalang'i eulukhuma, eyima khulia omundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhiingilile lukali mu lisuubila lienywe nio mu mukhaye, sikila mumanyile muli basuubili basenywe mu sibala sioosi balikho babirira mu sinyaasio sifwaanane ne sisienywe sino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne enyuma we khunyaasibwa khulwe siise sikeekhe, Wele we kumwalaalo kwoosi, owamulaanga enywe khunyoola luyali lwa mindali mu Kristo, omwene akhamukhole babechufu ne khumuelesia kamaani, ne khuandalasibwa khwa ng'ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bunyali bube khu niye mindali na mindali! Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kimileembe kimimaliilisi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
